A relative body link whose target file does not exist is a `link` error on the link's own line;
the anchor is not checked, and a URL, a mailto, an absolute path, an anchor-only link and a link
in code on the same record produce nothing.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
